dialog show @s {"type":"minecraft:notice","title":{"text":"Driver Finnley","color":"aqua"},"body":[{"type":"minecraft:plain_message","contents":{"text":"1. Tap Let's race! and wait for GO.\n2. Swim through the START gate: the clock starts.\n3. Swim through the hoops in order, 1 to 11. Number 10 is the welcome arch. Your next hoop sparkles, and sparkles in front of you point the way.\n   Number 5 is the Bubble Lift: swim into the bubbles and they carry you up through it!\n4. Swim back through the gate to finish!\n\nNo flying during a race. You have 5 minutes. Your best time goes on the board, which you can see anywhere in the Undersea."}}],"action":{"label":"Got it!"}}
